      "c": "gold",
      "at": 0.6
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "The closest? उमरान मलिक, at one fifty-seven in the IPL in twenty twenty-two. मयंक यादव, one fifty-six point seven in twenty twenty-four. And in twenty twenty-six, Ashok Sharma hit one fifty-four. Shoaib's record still stands at over one sixty-one.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "gauge",
    "head": {
     "t": "THE FASTEST INDIANS",
     "sub": "KM/H · IPL"
    },
